<title>USA: PDT expands breast cancer trial.</title>
<headline>PDT expands breast cancer trial.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PDT Inc said it is expanding the Phase II/III clinical trial of its SnET2 photodynamic therapy for for cutaneous metastatic breast cancer to include a broader patient population.</p>
<p>Under the expanded guidelines, patients on certain chemotherapies and on hormone therapy will be able to participate in the trial.</p>
<p>PDT is testing a medical procedure using light-activated drugs to selectively destroy diseased cells and tissues.</p>
</text>
